{"id":"luchshe","lemma":"лучше","pos":"adv","rank":94,"glosses":["rather, would better (do something) (often used with verbs in the past tense with subjunctive бы (by))"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2f/Ru-%D0%BB%D1%83%D1%87%D1%88%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BB%D1%83%D1%87%D1%88%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Кто был лучше?","en":"Who was better?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Теперь тебе лучше?","en":"Are you better now?","words":[{"g":"now, at present"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null]},{"text":"Вам сегодня лучше?","en":"Do you feel better today?","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"today"},null]},{"text":"Ты всё помнишь лучше, чем я.","en":"You remember things better than I do.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1278861","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"to remember","l":"помнить"},null,{"g":"than"},{"g":"I"}]},{"text":"Твои не лучше моих.","en":"Yours are no better than mine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270090","words":[{"g":"your","l":"твой"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"}]}]}